OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on major road after
OL,4,Acar overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been warned of long
OL,7,Fdelays on the A23 in West Sussex after
OL,8,Fa car overturned, travel monitoring
OL,9,Fsite Inrix says.
OL,11,FThe website said the incident on the
OL,12,Fnorthbound carriageway between
OL,13,FHickstead Lane in Hickstead and the
OL,14,FA272 Cowfold Road in Bolney happened at
OL,15,Fabout 07:25 GMT on Tuesday morning.
OL,17,FCongestion was backed up to
OL,18,FMuddleswood, about 3.5 miles (5.6km)
OL,19,Faway, Inrix said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
